      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Cost-wise, last-minute bookings for either the Shinkansen or domestic flights can be expensive, but the comparison is always tricky, depending on how much you value your time. With the trains, you can sometimes find last-minute discounted tickets, especially if you book a slightly less premium seat. For the trains, aim for major hubs like Tokyo Station, Shin-Osaka Station, and Hakata Station in Fukuoka. These are the central points, so you won't be wandering around the less-used side terminals.",
